[21.407628, "o", "    20\t            bb.get(id);\r\n    21\t            if (same(id, b)) {\r\n    22\t                int rec = 4 + len;\r\n    23\t                int pad = (ALIGN - (rec % ALIGN)) % ALIGN;\r\n"]
